# The Beast Within (battlefield.beast_within#areas, Jade Sepulcher): four chars, each a level 75 Blue Mage at level cap
# 75, The Beast Within accepted at Quest[6][40]Prog 2 (GMs), one Blue Mage's Testimony; one player to a battlefield.
# main enters area 1 (33), bob area 2 (34), cat area 3 (35), each by the testimony: TESTIMONY_WEARS (3 shown, 2 left).
# dan's trade with all three areas taken: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7377, no menu. bob's RAUBAHN+1 brought to 1 HP: in the
# kill step RAUBAHN_YOUR_SOUL and RAUBAHN_GREATER_POWER (his mob script); at the fourth tick RAUBAHN_STRENGTH_FAILED_ME
# and 32001 (area 2); finished: event 6; finished: the scroll, completed. cat's RAUBAHN+2: in the kill step
# RAUBAHN_YOUR_SOUL, RAUBAHN_GREATER_POWER, RAUBAHN_STRENGTH_FAILED_ME and 32001 (area 3); four ticks; finished: event
# 6; finished: the scroll, completed.
